      </button>
      <div class="ml-faq-answer" role="region" aria-label="Answer: How can I ask for a specific training?">
        <p>To request a specific training, start by discussing your needs with your manager. If your manager reviews your request and identifies a real learning need, they will forward it to the Learning team for evaluation. The Learning team will then assess the request and decide whether the training can be approved or not.</p>
      </div>
