        <p>To organize a training, you should collect and confirm all the key details required to coordinate the session effectively. Make sure to review the following aspects:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Check whether the training has a cost.
            <br><em>If it does, the Learning team will contact the provider to request the invoice and register them as a supplier, in case they are not already in our system.</em>
          </li>
          <li>Number of hours.
            <br><em>If the training lasts 2 hours or more, it may be eligible for Fundae funding*.</em>
          </li>
          <li>Number of participants.</li>
          <li>Need for a training room (layout, pens and notepads, coffee service for long/corporate trainings, projector or other equipment).</li>
          <li>Training content and learning objectives.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Once all this information is collected, the Learning team can review the request and proceed with the organization of the training.</p>
